      "amount": "1/2 tsp"
    },
    {
      "name": "parsley",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the bowtie pasta according to the package instructions",
    "In a molcajete, heat the olive oil over medium heat",
    "Add the garlic and cook until fragrant",
    "Add the bhuna and cook for 2 minutes",
    "Add the spring onions and cook until they start to soften",
    "Add the lemon juice, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine",
    "Drain the pasta and add it to the molcajete",
    "Toss the pasta in the bhuna sauce until well coated",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve immediately"
  ],
